# StyleX migration rails (cohort + foundation)

- Follow `docs/agent-specs/emotion-to-stylex-grafana-ui.md`. Prefer `/emotion-to-stylex` for procedure.
- Do not add new `@emotion/css` or `@emotion/react` imports under cohort globs.
- Preserve `GrafanaTheme2` token semantics (colors, spacing, typography, shape, shadows, breakpoints, `flags.visualDesignRefresh`).
- Do not migrate Button, Box, Stack, Select, GlobalStyles, or `public/app/features/**` unless the spec is updated first.
- Do not edit `.cursor/hooks.json`.
- Do not change public component props/ref/a11y contracts for drive-by cleanup.
- After each batch, run the skill verify gate before claiming progress.
